oin=\"round\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" fill=\"none\" role=\"img\"><path d=\"M 1,6 H 14\" /><path d=\"M 1,11 H 14\" /><path d=\"m 1,16 h 9\" /><path d=\"M 18,11 V 21\" /><path d=\"M 13,16 H 23\" /></svg><span class=\"full_label\">Add To Collection</span><span class=\"mobile_label\">Collection</span></a></li><li class=\"devlog_link\"><a href=\"https://ebihime.itch.io/my-darling-dark-elf/devlog\" class=\"action_btn\"><svg aria-hidden version=\"1.1\" class=\"svgicon icon_news\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" fill=\"none\" role=\"img\"><rect x=\"1\" y=\"3\" width=\"22\" height=\"18\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"8\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"8\"></line><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"16\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"16\"></line></svg>Devlog</a></li><li><a data-label=\"related_btn\" href=\"https://itch.io/games-like/4979661/my-darling-dark-elf\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"action_btn related_games_btn\"><svg aria-hidden version=\"1.1\" class=\"svgicon icon_map\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" fill=\"none\" role=\"img\"><polygon points=\"1 6 1 22 8 18 16 22 23 18 23 2 16 6 8 2 1 6\"></polygon><line x1=\"8\" y1=\"2\" x2=\"8\" y2=\"18\"></line><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"16\" y2=\"22\"></line></svg> <span class=\"full_label\">Related games</span><span class=\"mobile_label\">Related</span></a></li></ul><script type=\"text/javascript\">new I.GameUserTools('#user_tools')</script><div id=\"wrapper\" class=\"main wrapper game_page_wrapper\"><div id=\"inner_column\" class=\"inner_column size_very_large family_nunito-sans\"><div class=\"header align_center has_image\" id=\"header\"><img alt=\"My Darling Dark Elf\" src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI5ODE4MzkwLnBuZw==/original/eeSKey.png\"/><h1 itemprop=\"name\" class=\"game_title\">My Darling Dark Elf</h1></div><div itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Product\" id=\"view_game_658806\" itemscope class=\"view_game_page page_widget base_widget buy_on_top\"><div class=\"header_buy_row\"><p>A downloadable game for Windows, macOS, Linux, and Android</p><div class=\"buy_row\"><div class=\"button_message\"><a href=\"https://ebihime.itch.io/my-darling-dark-elf/purchase\" class=\"button buy_btn\">Buy Now</a><span class=\"buy_message\"><span itemprop=\"price\" class=\"dollars\">$9.99 USD</span> <span class=\"sub\">or more</span></span></div></div></div><div class=\"columns\"><div class=\"left_col column\"><div class=\"formatted_description user_formatted\"><figure><img style=\"color: inherit; font-size: inherit; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; border-style: none; border-color: currentcolor\" height=\"143\" width=\"592\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4099120/extras/6e63ad288c2ddbad4d64bc77ae332ffe.avif?t=1786288598\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>\r\n<p>Nienke is a dark elf who lives in the small, peaceful village of Alpenrose. Though beautiful, Alpenrose is secluded, and it boasts exactly one family of dark elves: Nienke&#x27;s. Nienke has been teased for most of her life owing&nbsp;to her unusual appearance, and it doesn&#x27;t help that a nasty childhood illness left her much shorter than the rest of her peers.<br><br>Nienke was always an outcast, but she never minded that. She had her best friend Cornelia, and she wasn&#x27;t lonely...<br><br>But then Cornelia&nbsp;leaves Alpenrose to attend university, leaving Nienke behind.<br><br>Nienke would love to attend university herself, but her overprotective parents don&#x27;t want to let her stray too far afield owing to her delicate health. Nienke has to stay at home instead, to help her parents with their&nbsp;café, Fleur de Lys. Nienke&#x27;s days are all the same, and she soon tires of the daily grind...<br><br>Until a fellow dark elf called Merel pays Nienke a visit. She claims to be Nienke&#x27;s childhood friend, though Nienke can&#x27;t remember her. Did she really used to play with a girl as aggressively cheerful and energetic as Merel&nbsp;&mdash; and why is Merel so freaking tall?!<br><br>\r\n</p>\r\n<figure><span><img style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; border-style: none; border-color: currentcolor; max-width: 100%\" height=\"143\" width=\"592\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4099120/extras/8d63b705a68a34b844ccd032678a78a4.avif?t=1786288598\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></figure>\r\n<p>- 80,000 words of text (approx 4-5 hours of reading)<br>- A linear story with no choices and only one ending<br>- Adorable character artwork by Toromi<br>- A custom soundtrack<br>- Two very cute dark elves<br>- A slowly developing romance story<br>- Maids<br>- Pointy elf ears!<br><br>\r\n</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI5ODE4MzEzLnBuZw==/original/kn5HW%2B.png\" loading=\"lazy\"><br>Writing/programming: <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://x.com/ebihimes\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\">ebi-hime</a><br>Character art: Toromi<br>Chibi art: <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://x.com/_pudd1ncup\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\">Pudd1ncup</a><br>Additional art: <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://x.com/Saitoki7\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\">Saitoki</a><br>Background art: <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://x.com/Luciam_AS\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\">Luciam Art Studio</a><br>GUI: <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://x.com/MarySueGames\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\">MarySueGames</a><br>Music: <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://lentilcorelli.com/\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\">Lentil</a><br>Opening video: <a href=\"https://x.com/signormao_art\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\">Signor Mao</a><br>Proofreading: <a target=\"_blank\" 